msgid ""
"Advances received from public or private organizations to finance the "
"company's activities, for which repayment is conditional, are presented "
"under equity in the balance sheet as \"Other Equity.\" Corresponding "
"interest expenses are recorded as liabilities under \"Loans and Other "
"Financial Debts.\""
msgstr ""
"Forskud modtaget fra offentlige eller private organisationer til "
"finansiering af virksomhedens aktiviteter, hvor tilbagebetaling er betinget, "
"præsenteres under egenkapitalen i statusopgørelsen som \"Anden "
"egenkapital\". Tilsvarende renteudgifter bogføres som forpligtelser under "
"\"Lån og anden finansiel gæld\"."

