#. module: accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:accountant_knowledge.accountant_knowledge_article_template_subventions
msgid ""
"The company has received subsidies that are recognized in operating income "
"in proportion to the expenses incurred. As a result, subsidies receivable "
"may be recorded when the grant agreement is signed and eligible expenses "
"have been incurred, even if the funds have not yet been received."
msgstr ""
"Virksomheden har modtaget offentlige tilskud, som indregnes i "
"driftsindtægterne i takt med, at de tilhørende udgifter afholdes. "
"Tilgodehavender vedrørende tilskud indregnes derfor, når tilskudsaftalen er "
"underskrevet, og de støtteberettigede udgifter er afholdt, selv om "
"tilskuddet endnu ikke er modtaget."

